1st task module: "math.js and index.js"
👉 Notes:
module.exports = file ke functions/objects ko bahar bhejna.
require("./filename") = un functions ko import karna.

2nd task module fs: "file_module_task.js"
👉 Notes:
writeFileSync = nayi file banata hai ya purani overwrite karta hai.
readFileSync = file ka data read karta hai.
appendFileSync = purani file me text add karta hai.
unlinkSync = file delete karta hai.

3rd task module path: "path_module_task.js"
👉 Notes:
basename = file ka naam return karta hai.
dirname = directory path return karta hai.
extname = extension return karta hai (e.g. .js).
join = multiple paths ko combine karta hai safely.

4rd task module: "os_module_task.js"
👉 Notes:
os.type() → OS ka type (Darwin = Mac, Linux, Windows_NT).
os.totalmem() → total RAM.
os.freemem() → free RAM.

5rd task module: "http_module_task.js"
👉 Notes:
http.createServer() = server banata hai.
res.writeHead(200) = status code + headers.
res.end() = response bhejta hai.
server.listen(3000) = server port 3000 pe chal raha hai.

